      "text": {
        "en": "The vast majority of dog owners highlight the salon's gentle and loving care, noting that pets return home happy, calm, and eager to visit for grooming. Clients praise the staff's patience with energetic and nervous dogs. However, several critical reviews allege rough handling and negligence during certain grooming sessions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 37,
      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming staff alongside customer service disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners describe the salon team as friendly, polite, and accommodating, appreciating warm customer service and attentive check-in procedures. On the other hand, a small number of dissatisfied clients reported contentious interactions with management following disputes over grooming results and pet care concerns."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 37,
      "title": {
        "en": "Neat grooming cuts and clean coats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently compliment the grooming quality, noting that dogs leave smelling fresh, well-brushed, and neatly trimmed according to owner specifications. Reviewers frequently praise thorough baths, nail clipping, and deshedding treatments. A few dissatisfied owners reported uneven haircuts or minor grooming injuries."
      }
    }
  ],
